  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture Groundnuts (Self-help Grant) Beneficiaries: 420 of which 280 are women This small grant groundnuts project will help small scale farmers to earn increased income. USADF funds will help 420 people to purchase an electric roaster, ground nut peeler and grinder as well as packaging materials and additional raw materials.</narrative>
